{"logId": "6ca4ce15-64ec-456e-b3bb-41a57f37e530", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "DÍ", "block_bbox": [121, 91, 192, 128], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[121.0, 91.0], [192.0, 91.0], [192.0, 128.0], [121.0, 128.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（三）为防范网络欺诈，应注意以下几点：", "block_bbox": [110, 161, 483, 187], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[110.0, 161.0], [483.0, 161.0], [483.0, 187.0], [110.0, 187.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、网上购物一定要到正规的购物网站，使用比较安全的支付宝、U盾等支付工具支付。", "block_bbox": [104, 190, 697, 243], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[104.0, 190.0], [697.0, 190.0], [697.0, 243.0], [104.0, 243.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、不要在网上购买非正当产品，如手机监听器、毕业证书等所谓的“商品”，几乎百分百是骗局。", "block_bbox": [104, 247, 696, 301], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[104.0, 247.0], [696.0, 247.0], [696.0, 301.0], [104.0, 301.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、凡是以各种名义要求你先付款的信息，请不要轻信，也不要轻易把自己的银行卡借给他人。", "block_bbox": [104, 304, 696, 357], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[104.0, 304.0], [696.0, 304.0], [696.0, 357.0], [104.0, 357.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、提高自我保护意识，注意妥善保管自己的私人信息，如本人证件号码、账号、密码等，不向他人透露，并尽量避免在网吧等公共场所使用网上电子商务服务。", "block_bbox": [104, 361, 706, 443], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[104.0, 361.0], [706.0, 361.0], [706.0, 443.0], [104.0, 443.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、对于需要预先支付费用的网上中奖信息、彩票预测信息和股票投资信息切不可相信。", "block_bbox": [104, 447, 697, 500], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[104.0, 447.0], [697.0, 447.0], [697.0, 500.0], [104.0, 500.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、对于QQ、微信中好友的借钱不轻易相信、可通过电话等途径核实后再作决定。", "block_bbox": [104, 504, 695, 557], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[104.0, 504.0], [695.0, 504.0], [695.0, 557.0], [104.0, 557.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "7、不与网上结识、现实中无过多交往、身份不能确认的朋友发生大额的借贷关系。", "block_bbox": [103, 560, 698, 615], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[103.0, 560.0], [698.0, 560.0], [698.0, 615.0], [103.0, 615.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [802, 200, 1078, 546], "block_id": 9, "block_order": null, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[802.0, 200.0], [1078.0, 200.0], [1078.0, 546.0], [802.0, 546.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "生活篇--交通安全", "block_bbox": [93, 679, 308, 711], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[93.0, 679.0], [308.0, 679.0], [308.0, 711.0], [93.0, 711.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "DÍ", "block_bbox": [121, 827, 192, 864], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[121.0, 827.0], [192.0, 827.0], [192.0, 864.0], [121.0, 864.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [94, 800, 1127, 888], "block_id": 12, "block_order": null, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[94.0, 800.0], [1127.0, 800.0], [1127.0, 888.0], [94.0, 888.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "四、交通安全", "block_bbox": [132, 897, 273, 927], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[132.0, 897.0], [273.0, 897.0], [273.0, 927.0], [132.0, 927.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "案例：", "block_bbox": [131, 1001, 211, 1027], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[131.0, 1001.0], [210.0, 1001.0], [210.0, 1026.0], [131.0, 1026.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、2013年，时代两名员工下班后没有走人行横道横穿马路，被一辆自东向西的轿车碰撞，导致一人脾脏切除手术，一人颅骨抽出淤血手术，事后两人还要承担交通责任。", "block_bbox": [130, 1030, 594, 1140], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[130.0, 1030.0], [594.0, 1030.0], [594.0, 1140.0], [130.0, 1140.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、2013年，广场一名员工上班途中骑电动车与一自行车相撞，自行车把撞住其腹部，造成内出血肋骨骨折两根；", "block_bbox": [130, 1144, 593, 1226], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[130.0, 1144.0], [593.0, 1144.0], [593.0, 1226.0], [130.0, 1226.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、2015年，广场一名员工下晚班喝酒后驾驶摩托车没有戴头盔，出交通事故，经抢救无效身亡；", "block_bbox": [130, 1229, 592, 1284], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[130.0, 1229.0], [592.0, 1229.0], [592.0, 1284.0], [130.0, 1284.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [670, 1012, 1078, 1271], "block_id": 18, "block_order": null, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[670.0, 1012.0], [1078.0, 1012.0], [1078.0, 1271.0], [670.0, 1271.0]]}, {"block_label": "footer_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [939, 1330, 1122, 1379], "block_id": 19, "block_order": null, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[939.0, 1330.0], [1122.0, 1330.0], [1122.0, 1379.0], [939.0, 1379.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.44482842087745667, "coordinate": [121, 91, 192, 128], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[121.0, 91.0], [192.0, 91.0], [192.0, 128.0], [121.0, 128.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.6098662614822388, "coordinate": [110, 161, 483, 187], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[110.0, 161.0], [483.0, 161.0], [483.0, 187.0], [110.0, 187.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9158779978752136, "coordinate": [104, 190, 697, 243], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[104.0, 190.0], [697.0, 190.0], [697.0, 243.0], [104.0, 243.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9125018119812012, "coordinate": [104, 247, 696, 301], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[104.0, 247.0], [696.0, 247.0], [696.0, 301.0], [104.0, 301.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9067386984825134, "coordinate": [104, 304, 696, 357], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[104.0, 304.0], [696.0, 304.0], [696.0, 357.0], [104.0, 357.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9358240365982056, "coordinate": [104, 361, 706, 443], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[104.0, 361.0], [706.0, 361.0], [706.0, 443.0], [104.0, 443.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9106212854385376, "coordinate": [104, 447, 697, 500], "order": 7, "polygon_points": [[104.0, 447.0], [697.0, 447.0], [697.0, 500.0], [104.0, 500.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9121212959289551, "coordinate": [104, 504, 695, 557], "order": 8, "polygon_points": [[104.0, 504.0], [695.0, 504.0], [695.0, 557.0], [104.0, 557.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8991967439651489, "coordinate": [103, 560, 698, 615], "order": 9, "polygon_points": [[103.0, 560.0], [698.0, 560.0], [698.0, 615.0], [103.0, 615.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.899067223072052, "coordinate": [802, 200, 1078, 546], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[802.0, 200.0], [1078.0, 200.0], [1078.0, 546.0], [802.0, 546.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8581041097640991, "coordinate": [93, 679, 308, 711], "order": 10, "polygon_points": [[93.0, 679.0], [308.0, 679.0], [308.0, 711.0], [93.0, 711.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.44900310039520264, "coordinate": [121, 827, 192, 864], "order": 11, "polygon_points": [[121.0, 827.0], [192.0, 827.0], [192.0, 864.0], [121.0, 864.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.3734112083911896, "coordinate": [94, 800, 1127, 888], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[94.0, 800.0], [1127.0, 800.0], [1127.0, 888.0], [94.0, 888.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8478734493255615, "coordinate": [132, 897, 273, 927], "order": 12, "polygon_points": [[132.0, 897.0], [273.0, 897.0], [273.0, 927.0], [132.0, 927.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.6381949782371521, "coordinate": [131, 1001, 211, 1027], "order": 13, "polygon_points": [[131.0, 1001.0], [210.0, 1001.0], [210.0, 1026.0], [131.0, 1026.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9464649558067322, "coordinate": [130, 1030, 594, 1140], "order": 14, "polygon_points": [[130.0, 1030.0], [594.0, 1030.0], [594.0, 1140.0], [130.0, 1140.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9410913586616516, "coordinate": [130, 1144, 593, 1226], "order": 15, "polygon_points": [[130.0, 1144.0], [593.0, 1144.0], [593.0, 1226.0], [130.0, 1226.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9168491959571838, "coordinate": [130, 1229, 592, 1284], "order": 16, "polygon_points": [[130.0, 1229.0], [592.0, 1229.0], [592.0, 1284.0], [130.0, 1284.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.9149526357650757, "coordinate": [670, 1012, 1078, 1271], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[670.0, 1012.0], [1078.0, 1012.0], [1078.0, 1271.0], [670.0, 1271.0]]}, {"cls_id": 9, "label": "footer_image", "score": 0.801262378692627, "coordinate": [939, 1330, 1122, 1379], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[939.0, 1330.0], [1122.0, 1330.0], [1122.0, 1379.0], [939.0, 1379.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## DÍ\n\n（三）为防范网络欺诈，应注意以下几点：\n\n1、网上购物一定要到正规的购物网站，使用比较安全的支付宝、U盾等支付工具支付。\n\n2、不要在网上购买非正当产品，如手机监听器、毕业证书等所谓的“商品”，几乎百分百是骗局。\n\n3、凡是以各种名义要求你先付款的信息，请不要轻信，也不要轻易把自己的银行卡借给他人。\n\n4、提高自我保护意识，注意妥善保管自己的私人信息，如本人证件号码、账号、密码等，不向他人透露，并尽量避免在网吧等公共场所使用网上电子商务服务。\n\n5、对于需要预先支付费用的网上中奖信息、彩票预测信息和股票投资信息切不可相信。\n\n6、对于QQ、微信中好友的借钱不轻易相信、可通过电话等途径核实后再作决定。\n\n7、不与网上结识、现实中无过多交往、身份不能确认的朋友发生大额的借贷关系。\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_802_200_1078_546.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"23%\" /></div>\n\n\n## 生活篇--交通安全\n\n## DÍ\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_94_800_1127_888.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"86%\" /></div>\n\n\n## 四、 交通安全\n\n## 案例：\n\n1、2013年，时代两名员工下班后没有走人行横道横穿马路，被一辆自东向西的轿车碰撞，导致一人脾脏切除手术，一人颅骨抽出淤血手术，事后两人还要承担交通责任。\n\n2、2013年，广场一名员工上班途中骑电动车与一自行车相撞，自行车把撞住其腹部，造成内出血肋骨骨折两根；\n\n3、2015年，广场一名员工下晚班喝酒后驾驶摩托车没有戴头盔，出交通事故，经抢救无效身亡；\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_670_1012_1078_1271.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"34%\" /></div>\n", "images": {"imgs/img_in_image_box_802_200_1078_546.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//6ca4ce15-64ec-456e-b3bb-41a57f37e530/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_802_200_1078_546.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A52%3A16Z%2F-1%2F%2F2d00555f7a68b6e0ea52fa323a868864fe4ab2dbb102d74ad77ff2c13b8e2b91", "imgs/img_in_image_box_94_800_1127_888.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//6ca4ce15-64ec-456e-b3bb-41a57f37e530/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_94_800_1127_888.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A52%3A16Z%2F-1%2F%2Feee486b52228ae18448a34f0191f256f40c1c6a28d0410eac01cae0dc7f30b81", "imgs/img_in_image_box_670_1012_1078_1271.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//6ca4ce15-64ec-456e-b3bb-41a57f37e530/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_670_1012_1078_1271.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T10%3A52%3A16Z%2F-1%2F%2F0b0e082e9e0e1e3bfe862ae697fbb5caea2ca32e147a994e09dd209755afab4b", "imgs/img_in_footer_image_box_939_1330_1122_1379.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//6ca4ce1